WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.440
 Hi, Marvel fans.

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:04.235
I am here with Victoria
Alonso, executive producer.

00:00:04.235 --> 00:00:05.540
How are you doing?
- I'm great.

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:06.340
I'm excited.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:09.630
Now Zendaya is coming, so
that's the party right there.

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:11.590
 I mean, we got a party
going on here, too.

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:12.580
 We had a--

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:13.380
Yes.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.290
Today is a good day today.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:15.540
Today is a good day.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:19.890
We get to celebrate Spider-man,
one of my favorite characters.

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:23.850
Not the favorite, but
one of my favorites.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:25.290
 Nice save.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:26.730
 They're all my favorites.

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:28.080
 Tonight is a big night.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.560
This is the biggest Spider-man
film that we've seen today.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:34.750
And the VFX are on
a whole other level.

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.340
Can you talk about
that just a little bit?

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.010
Just, there's just so
much that went into this.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.620
 You know, the
thing about working

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.300
on these things it just feels--

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:46.020
During the pandemic this
took far more effort

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.270
because we were not together.

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:52.210
And I think that what I longed
for is to be together again.

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:55.860
But we got it done thanks
to the 6,000 plus people

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.250
across the world.

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.180
So I thank every
single vendor facility,

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:02.700
human artist, and
family member that put

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.530
up with us working from home.

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.990
And hopefully you can
all go see it and shh.

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:11.610
Keep the secrets.

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:13.620
 I thought you were
going to tell us a secret.

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:14.420
 Shh.

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:15.840
I'll say no-- Are
you kidding me?

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:17.010
- I dunno.
- I'd rather--

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:17.810
 I dunno.

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:19.740
 --not saying anything.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:20.700
 All right.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:23.300
Well what are you most excited
about with this film tonight?

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:27.380
 I'm excited to see how people
react to something that's

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:29.820
been with us for so long.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:34.690
So I'm just ready, ready for
all of you to know what I know.

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:38.270
 OK, well I'm
ready for that, too.

00:01:38.270 --> 00:01:41.700
How did you and your
team pull this off?

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.850
 Well, you know, every
movie takes a lot of effort.

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:46.310
So it just was effort,
effort, effort.

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:47.580
And we have the
best team, you know.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:51.320
Amy, Kevin, we have John
Watts, who's fantastic,

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:56.210
and we have a beautiful trio
in Zendaya and Tom and Jake.

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:58.140
And the friends are back.

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:02.060
They're back in town, so they
get to tell another story.

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:03.030
 That's beautiful.

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:06.200
What does this
night mean to you?

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:09.590
 I hope that this gift of
filmmaking that we put out

00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:11.900
there to the world is
received with as much love

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:13.930
as we made it.

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:16.280
 That made my heart
feel like mushy.

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:17.210
I love that.

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:18.290
Well I don't want to keep you.

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:19.917
Enjoy the rest of
your red carpet.

00:02:19.917 --> 00:02:21.050
I look forward to
seeing the film.

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:22.390
 Thank you.
Thank you for your support.

00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:24.000
And if I don't see you anymore.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.670
I think that's it for this year.

00:02:25.670 --> 00:02:28.140
We have nine projects
that came this year.

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:29.330
Happy holidays.

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:31.550
We represented with
all of our hearts

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:32.780
so we'll see you after this.

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:33.870
We'll see you next year.

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:34.670
 All right, see you.

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:35.810
Thank you.

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:39.460
[MUSIC PLAYING]

